          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Five minutes still counts. Tendo never needs to know what you are listening to. If you get interrupted, Pick Up Where You Left Off gives you a direct way back, and Welcome Back keeps that return gentle."
          }
        },
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tudi pet minut šteje. Tendo nikoli ne potrebuje podatka, kaj poslušate. Ob prekinitvi vas Nadaljujte, kjer ste ostali popelje neposredno nazaj, Dobrodošel nazaj pa poskrbi za nežno vrnitev."
          }
        }
      }
    },
