            "value": "Backup from %1$(date)@: %2$(tasks)lld tasks, %3$(routines)lld routines, %4$(focusSessions)lld focus sessions. Restoring replaces the Tendo-owned data currently on this device. Calendar and Reminders are not changed."
          }
        },
        "sl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Varnostna kopija z dne %1$(date)@: opravila: %2$(tasks)lld, rutine: %3$(routines)lld, seje osredotočenosti: %4$(focusSessions)lld. Obnova nadomesti trenutne podatke Tendo v tej napravi. Koledar in Opomniki ostanejo nespremenjeni."
          }
        }
      }
    },
